      *C   THIS NEW PARAGRAPH WAS ADDED TO THIS VERSION JUST TO KEEP
      *C   THINGS IN SYNCH.
      *C
      *C   05OCT1993         DAVE PLUM
      *C   INCREMENTED RECEIVED COUNTER FOR TRANS "31" AND "32" (AS JEFF
