      *C
      *C   11/23/93    BK DISMUKES   REQUEST 6402
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO VALIDATE PRODUCTION DATE.  ALSO INTRODUCED
      *C     PAGE BREAKS TO RAW MATERIAL WITHDRAWALS WITH NEW PROD DATES.
      *C
      *C   03FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER ROUTINE - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   08/15/1995   CA YODER    REQ# 95-022
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO USE THE VALUE IN MPLTINFO FOR ESTIMATED
      *C     LEAD TIME IN MSTORERM IF THE SWITCH IS SET TO YES.
      *C
      *C   09/17/96     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     INCLUDE CENTURY ON STOREROOM AND REQ DATES.
      *C
      *C   1/14/97    BILL ROXBURY REQ #95-012
      *C     ADDS OR DELETES ENTRIES FROM
      *C     NEW RECEIVING FILE (MCFLCSRCPT).
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
