DP17A9*C  17AUG1999   DAVE PLUM
DP17A9*C     REMOVED THE CHECK WHICH REQUIRED VENDOR CODES (TC 70,
DP17A9*C     TC 71, AND TC 72) TO BE NUMERIC.  VENDORS CREATED IN
DP17A9*C     SAP R/3 FOR NA TIRE (SYNERGY) ALL START WITH THE LETTER
DP17A9*C     "S".
DP17A9*C
DP23J0*C 23JUN2000   DAVE PLUM
DP23J0*C     BECAUSE OF THE CHANGE FROM RJE TO FTP FOR SOUTH PACIFIC
DP23J0*C     TYRE (AUSTRALIA), DESCRIPTION UPDATES FROM PG509 OF
DP23J0*C     P7200000 NO LONGER CONTAIN A CARRAIGE CONTROL CHARACTER
DP23J0*C     IN THE FIRST COLUMN.  THEREFORE, INSTEAD OF UTILIZING
DP23J0*C     BYTES 2 THROUGH 133 AS THE DATA PORTION OF THE RECORD,
DP23J0*C     WE NEED TO UTILIZE BYTES 1 THROUGH 132.  FOR SPT PLANTS
DP23J0*C     THE 133 BYTE INPUT RECORD (AKRON-FD-RECORD) WILL BE
DP23J0*C     MOVED TO AKRON-WS-DATA INSTEAD OF AKRON-WS-RCD.  THIS
DP23J0*C     CHANGE IS SIMILAR TO THE CHANGE MADE TO THE HP-3000
DP23J0*C     VERSION OF THIS PROGRAM FOR DEBICA, POLAND IN
DP23J0*C     DECEMBER 1998.
DP23J0*C
BG1155*C 04JUN2001   BRUCE GEISER
BG1155*C     BECAUSE OF THE CHANGE FROM RJE TO FTP FOR MARIKINA(364)
BG1155*C     AND LAS PINAS(664) TREAT LIKE OTHER FTP PLANTS.
BG1155*C
      *C 14NOV2002   CA YODER
